            $this->faq('Can the platform support smallholders, cooperatives and commercial farms?', 'Yes. Producer, group, cooperative, contract and commercial-farm structures can be configured while preserving the source of each lot and the agreed privacy and settlement rules.', 'آیا platform smallholder، cooperative و commercial farm را پشتیبانی می‌کند؟', 'بلی. ساختار producer، group، cooperative، contract و commercial farm با حفظ source هر lot و privacy/settlement rule تنظیم می‌شود.', 'ایا platform smallholder، cooperative او commercial farm اداره کوي؟', 'هو. producer، group، cooperative، contract او commercial farm جوړښت د هر lot source او privacy/settlement rule په ساتلو تنظیمېږي.'),
            $this->faq('Can field teams work without continuous internet?', 'A controlled offline workflow may support visits, activities, quantities, lots and evidence. Devices, identity, timestamps, synchronization, conflict handling and later review must be tested.', 'آیا field team بدون اینترنت دوامدار کار می‌کند؟', 'offline workflow می‌تواند visit، activity، quantity، lot و evidence را support کند. device، identity، timestamp، sync، conflict و review باید test شود.', 'ایا field team له دوامدار انټرنېټ پرته کار کوي؟', 'offline workflow د visit، activity، quantity، lot او evidence ملاتړ کولی شي. device، identity، timestamp، sync، conflict او review باید test شي.'),
            $this->faq('Does a mapped plot record prove land ownership?', 'No. A reported, mapped or verified operational location is not cadastral evidence or a legal decision about ownership or use rights.', 'آیا mapped plot record مالکیت زمین را ثابت می‌کند؟', 'خیر. operational location گزارش‌شده، mapped یا verified، cadastral evidence یا legal decision درباره ownership/use right نیست.', 'ایا mapped plot record د ځمکې مالکیت ثابتوي؟', 'نه. reported، mapped یا verified operational location، cadastral evidence یا د ownership/use right قانوني پرېکړه نه ده.'),
            $this->faq('Can harvest lots be traced through storage and sale?', 'Yes, when producer, plot, season, harvest, weights, quality, aggregation, transformation, storage, dispatch and delivery events consistently preserve lot relationships.', 'آیا harvest lot تا storage و sale پیگیری می‌شود؟', 'بلی، وقتی producer، plot، season، harvest، weight، quality، aggregation، transformation، storage، dispatch و delivery رابطه lot را منظم حفظ کند.', 'ایا harvest lot تر storage او sale پورې تعقیبېږي؟', 'هو، کله چې producer، plot، season، harvest، weight، quality، aggregation، transformation، storage، dispatch او delivery د lot اړیکه منظم وساتي.'),
            $this->faq('What agriculture data should be migrated?', 'Validated producers, consent, farms and plots, active seasons, crops, input and stock balances, lots, contracts, advances, settlements and selected history can be migrated.', 'کدام agriculture data migrate شود؟', 'producer، consent، farm/plot، active season، crop، input/stock balance، lot، contract، advance، settlement و history انتخابی پس از validation منتقل می‌شود.', 'کوم agriculture data ولېږدول شي؟', 'validated producer، consent، farm/plot، active season، crop، input/stock balance، lot، contract، advance، settlement او ټاکلی history لېږدول کېږي.'),
            $this->faq('How is agriculture software priced?', 'Pricing depends on producer and farm structures, locations, seasons, commodities, field users, offline needs, facilities, traceability, integrations, migration, deployment, training and support.', 'قیمت agriculture software چگونه تعیین می‌شود؟', 'قیمت به producer/farm structure، location، season، commodity، field user، offline، facility، traceability، integration، migration، deployment، training و support وابسته است.', 'د agriculture software بیه څنګه ټاکل کېږي؟', 'بیه په producer/farm structure، location، season، commodity، field user، offline، facility، traceability، integration، migration، deployment، training او support پورې تړلې ده.'),
